			"notes": "**EasyTrading 11.26.01**\n\n- Redesigned /market pur into a simple chat-based flow.\n- Search by item name or Minecraft ID with typo-tolerant matching.\n- Search results now include all available items, not only blocks.\n- Item quantity now respects vanilla stack sizes:\n        Non-stackable items: 1\n        16-stack items: up to 16\n        Regular items: up to 64\n- Fixed purchase orders failing to save with large stack amounts.\n- Improved English and Russian purchase-order messages."
		},
