			"notes": "## Meet EasyTrading 09.26.01!\n\n- Improved the /market GUI by restoring the bank rates info panel.\n- Players can now see the current dynamic bank buy/sell prices directly inside the market menu.\n- Refined market interface behavior for clearer price visibility and smoother navigation.\n- Fixed a critical GUI display issue where the bank price list was missing or not shown correctly in the main market view."
